        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPC-200, Modern 2 Inch Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe really like the 2 inch Ring Pull for its modern look. The square mount and angular grip gives this solid brass ring pull it a contemporary feel. It has a 2 inch diameter and a 13/16 inch projection. Among other finishes, it is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished chrome. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Larger <a href=\"/products/3-inch-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpc-300\">3\" Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RPC200 Circle Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Grip Cutout Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
